{"3963640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DreamHero", "steam_appid": 3963640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overhead perspective action-adventure game centered on &quot;hero capture and diverse combat&quot;. Players experience a variety of gameplay modes, from single-player missions to multiplayer competitions, in the &quot;Dream World&quot;. The feature is that powerful defeated enemies can be transformed into playable heroes to form an exclusive lineup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero System: The core is the &quot;dynamic hero pool&quot;. In addition to initial characters, defeating elites/BOSSes or clearing levels gives a chance to capture enemies as heroes. Rare heroes require completing specific maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963640/extras/9ed44b9497ac371a67ca9be712cdf3a5.avif?t=1788276044\" width=1028 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963640/extras/5e821e4a6e46dd3ab9620d2a87cc5c29.avif?t=1788276044\" width=1028 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963640/extras/64b6c1785de33d746dd60f18d059a0f3.avif?t=1788276044\" width=1028 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963640/extras/1c846f4a16e506a04a72a0b83c7c36c4.avif?t=1788276044\" width=1028 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963640/extras/ad24a815e87e882722016bebfac6211e.avif?t=1788276044\" width=1028 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Single-player Mode : Story mode includes linear levels and BOSS battles, with limited heroes unlocked upon clearance; Roguelike mode features random maps, events, items, and enemy combinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. PVP Battles : 1V1 fast-paced duels; 5V5 team competitions emphasizing division of labor; 20-player battle royale on a super-large map, where fragments can be picked up to unlock temporary heroes, and the last survivor wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Multiplayer PVE : 3-4 players team up to challenge high-difficulty dungeons, with hero star-up materials dropped.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overhead perspective action-adventure game centered on &quot;hero capture and diverse combat&quot;. Players experience a variety of gameplay modes, from single-player missions to multiplayer competitions, in the &quot;Dream World&quot;. The feature is that powerful defeated enemies can be transformed into playable heroes to form an exclusive lineup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero System: The core is the &quot;dynamic hero pool&quot;. In addition to initial characters, defeating elites/BOSSes or clearing levels gives a chance to capture enemies as heroes. Rare heroes require completing specific maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963640/extras/9ed44b9497ac371a67ca9be712cdf3a5.avif?t=1788276044\" width=1028 height=780 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963640/extras/5e821e4a6e46dd3a